{{define "account/addresses/index"}}{{template "layouts/account/start" .}}{{template "partials/breadcrumbs" (dict "HomeURL" "/account" "HomeLabel" "Account" "Current" "Addresses")}}{{template "partials/page-header" (dict "Title" "My Addresses" "Description" "Manage shipping and billing addresses." "ActionURL" "/account/addresses/new" "ActionLabel" "+ Add Address")}}<div class="row g-4">{{$root := .}}{{range .Addresses}}<div class="col-md-6"><article class="address-card h-100"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start gap-3"><div><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3">{{if .IsDefault}}<span class="status-badge status-delivered">Default</span>{{end}}<span class="status-badge status-active">Shipping & billing</span></div><h2 class="h5">{{.FirstName}} {{.LastName}}</h2>{{if .Company}}<div>{{.Company}}</div>{{end}}<address class="text-muted mb-0">{{.Street}} {{.HouseNumber}}<br>{{if .AddressLine2}}{{.AddressLine2}}<br>{{end}}{{.PostalCode}} {{.City}}{{if .State}}, {{.State}}{{end}}<br>{{.CountryCode}}<br>{{.Phone}}</address></div></div><div class="action-buttons mt-4"><a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" href="/account/addresses/{{.ID}}/edit">Edit</a><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger" type="button" data-dialog-open="delete-address-{{.ID}}">Delete</button></div>{{template "partials/confirm-delete" (dict "ID" (printf "delete-address-%d" .ID) "Name" "address" "Message" "This saved address will be removed from your account." "Action" (printf "/account/addresses/%d/delete" .ID) "CSRF" $root.CSRFField)}}</article></div>{{else}}<div class="col-12">{{template "partials/empty-state" (dict "Title" "No addresses yet." "Description" "Add an address for faster checkout." "ActionURL" "/account/addresses/new" "ActionLabel" "Add your first address")}}</div>{{end}}</div>{{template "layouts/account/end" .}}{{end}}
